The genealogy of Jesus' family.
This is the genealogy of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.
Abraham was the father of Isaac. Isaac was the father of Jacob. Jacob was the father of Judah and his brothers.
Judah the father of Perez and Zerah, and Tamar their mother. Perez the father of Hezron. And Hezron the father of Ram.
Ram was the father of Amminadab. Amminadab was the father of Nahshon. Nahshon was the father of Salmon.
Boaz was the father of Obed. Ruth was the mother of Obed. Obed was the father of Jesse.
And Jesse was the father of king David. And David was the father of Solomon. And the mother of Solomon was the wife of Uriah.
Solomon was the father of Rehoboam. Rehoboam was the father of Abijah. Abijah was the father of Asa.
Asa was the son of Jehoshaphat. Jehoshaphat was the son of Jehoram. Jehoram was the son of Uzziah.
Uzziah the father of Jotham, Jotham the father of Ahaz, Ahaz the father of Hezekiah.
Hezekiah was the father of Menahem. Menahem was the father of Amnon. Amnon was the father of Yoshiyahu.
Josiah was the father of Jehoiakim and his brothers. At that time, the Jewish people were forced to leave for Babylon.
After this, the family tree continued. Jekoniah was the father of Shallum. Shallum was the father of Zorobabel.
Zerubbabel was the father of Abiud. Abiud was the father of Eliakim. Eliakim was the father of Azel.
Azer was the father of Zadok. Zadok was the father of Ahim. Ahim was the father of Elioen.
Eliud was the father of Eliezer. Eliezer was the father of Matthan. Matthan was the father of Jacob.
Jacob was the father of Joseph. Joseph was the husband of Mary. And Mary gave birth to Jesus, who is called the Christ.
There were 14 generations from Abraham to David. There were 14 generations from David to the time when the Jews were forced to leave for Babylon. There were 14 generations from that time to Christ. Jesus Christ was born.
